  m_Name: kor_the_scholar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Voidborne::Voidborne.NPCs.NpcDefinition
  id: kor_the_scholar
  displayName: Kor the Scholar
  description: Fifth rescued Kin. Found on a Sky Island. Reveals the truth about
    VORD's origin.
  section: Kin Survivors
  behaviors:
  - Establishes a Reading Lectern at the base.
  - Decodes Kin Tablets and VORD Recordings the player brings.
  - Reveals key story lore over multiple conversations.
  - Often paired with the Apothecary discussing old Kin theology.
  abilities:
  - Unlocks all Scholar archetype recipes.
  - Will translate any unknown text.
  - 'Personality: wise, sometimes overwhelming with information.'
  dropOrTradeItems:
  - Cannot be killed.
  - 'Death: Spirit unlocks the Knowledge Crystal endgame recipe.'
  isKillable: 0
  isQuestGiver: 1
